gb-parametric-tokens
====================

Credit
------
The character, effect and guild data started from GBPlaybook
(https://github.com/cleech/GBPlaybook), the Guild Ball play assist app, and the
guild crests come from its icon font. Thanks to its author and contributors for
the card data and the icons this generator is built on.

The condition icons in public/icons/conditions/ were drawn for this project.

Fonts
-----
The token fonts in public/fonts/ are licensed under the SIL Open Font License
1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), with each license file next to its font:
Saira Condensed, Fira Sans Condensed, Atkinson Hyperlegible, Lilita One,
Germania One and Fraunces.

The interface fonts (Big Noodle Titling, Barlow and JetBrains Mono) are
self-hosted through @cckarchev/shared, which carries their notices.

